			<item>
				<title>Talk: The CPython JIT (Chipy 2024)</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/post/chipyjit2024/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 11 Jul 2024 17:11:33 -0500</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/post/chipyjit2024/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;On July 11, 2024, I had the pleasure of delivering a talk, &lt;span class=&#34;italic&#34;&gt;The CPython Jit&lt;/span&gt;, at &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.chipy.org/&#34;&gt;The Chicago Python Meetup Group   &lt;/a&gt;. All of the slides, supporting details, links, repos, and live demos are available here.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>How to Get the New CPython JIT</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/post/try-cpython-jit/</link>
				<pubDate>Sun, 09 Jun 2024 15:43:59 -0400</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/post/try-cpython-jit/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;post-h2&#34;&gt;TL;DR&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p class=&#34;post-p&#34;&gt;To just build and run with the JIT:&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;m-2 border-2 border-gray-400&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;m-1&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34; data-lang=&#34;sh&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# Install Python Build Dependencies (https://devguide.python.org/getting-started/setup-building/)&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;git clone --depth &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; --branch v3.13.0b3 https://github.com/python/cpython.git&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nb&#34;&gt;cd&lt;/span&gt; cpython&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;./configure --enable-experimental-jit&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;make&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;./python -c &lt;span class=&#34;s1&#34;&gt;$&amp;#39;x=0\nfor i in range(5000):\n x+=i\nprint(x)&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p class=&#34;post-p&#34;&gt;To include some debug output, to show the JIT is running:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
